{% extends "template.njk" %}

{% set pageTitle = "Privacy notice - HMCTS API Marketplace - GOV.UK" %}
{% set breadcrumbs = [{ text: "Home", href: "/" }] %}

{% block content %}

<div class="govuk-grid-row">
  <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">

    <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Privacy notice</h1>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      We collect certain information about you when you use the API Marketplace. This page explains
      what kind of personal information we collect, how it&rsquo;s protected and how you can find out
      about it.
    </p>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      If we change this privacy policy, we&rsquo;ll notify all Marketplace users by email.
    </p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">UK GDPR lawful basis</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      We hold information about you as a software developer on the lawful basis of
      &ldquo;public task&rdquo; so that we can run the API Marketplace as a service to you.
    </p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">What personal information do we hold about you?</h2>

    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
      <li>Full name</li>
      <li>Email address</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">How we use your data</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      We use this information to create and administer user accounts on the API Marketplace. We
      don&rsquo;t share this information with anyone else.
    </p>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      We store your information so that your user account on the API Marketplace can function
      correctly, and so we can administer that access via our approval process for issuing production
      credentials. This includes sending you service updates and notices.
    </p>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      We delete your personal information when your user account is deleted and keep audit records of
      your user account activity for up to 6 years.
    </p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">How we protect your personal information</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      We comply with the UK General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).
    </p>

    <p class="govuk-body">We will:</p>

    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
      <li>tell you why the information is needed</li>
      <li>only ask for what&rsquo;s needed</li>
      <li>make sure no one has access to it who shouldn&rsquo;t</li>
      <li>only keep the information for as long as it&rsquo;s needed</li>
      <li>not make it available for commercial use</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Handling your information</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      Our staff are trained in handling information and understand how important it is to protect
      personal and other sensitive information.
    </p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Your rights</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">You have the right to request:</p>

    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
      <li>information about how your personal data is processed</li>
      <li>a copy of that personal data</li>
      <li>that anything inaccurate in your personal data is corrected immediately</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="govuk-body">You can also:</p>

    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
      <li>raise an objection about how your personal data is processed</li>
      <li>request that your personal data is erased if there is no longer a justification for it</li>
      <li>ask that the processing of your personal data is restricted in certain circumstances</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="govuk-body">If you have any of these requests, get in contact with our team.</p>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      <a class="govuk-link" href="mailto:APIMarketplace@hmcts.net">APIMarketplace@hmcts.net</a>
    </p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Your UK GDPR right to be forgotten</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      You can ask us to delete all the information we hold about you, if you no longer wish to be a
      user of the Marketplace. To do this contact our support team.
    </p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Children</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      The API Marketplace is not for use by children under the age of 16. We do not knowingly hold
      personal information on children under the age of 16.
    </p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">How to object or make a complaint</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      If you&rsquo;re unhappy with the way we handle your personal information, you can write to the
      Data Protection Officer at the HMCTS office advised by our support team.
    </p>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      You&rsquo;ll get a confirmation that we have received your complaint within 5 days and a full
      answer within 20 days. We will tell you if there is going to be a delay.
    </p>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      If you&rsquo;re unhappy with the answer or need any advice, contact the Information
      Commissioner&rsquo;s Office (ICO).
    </p>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      Information Commissioner<br>
      <a class="govuk-link" href="mailto:icocasework@ico.org.uk">icocasework@ico.org.uk</a>
    </p>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      The ICO can investigate your complaint and take action against anyone who has misused personal
      data.
    </p>

  </div>
</div>

{% endblock %}
